OL,3,GNEWSAMP says Grok was designed to make 
OL,4,Asexualised images                      
OL,6,FThe Grok chatbot tool was designed by  
OL,7,FElon Musk's SpaceX Super Intelligence  
OL,8,Fto generate sexualised and offensive   
OL,9,Fimages, an MP suing the company has    
OL,10,Fsaid.                                  
OL,12,FJess Asato, Labour MP for Lowestoft in 
OL,13,FSuffolk, is suing SpaceXSI for damages 
OL,14,Fafter sexualised images and videos,    
OL,15,Fincluding some depicting her being     
OL,16,Fsexually assaulted, were generated and 
OL,17,Fshared online using the AI tool.       
