OL,3,GNEWSAMP says Grok was designed to make 
OL,4,Asexualised images                      
OL,6,FHer claim alleges SpaceXSI's design    
OL,7,Fchoices make them responsible for      
OL,8,FGrok's output, and that the company    
OL,9,Fmisused her private information and    
OL,10,Fbreached data protection rules.        
OL,12,FSpaceXSI previously said users would no
OL,13,Flonger be able to use the tool to      
OL,14,Fgenerate sexualised images of real     
OL,15,Fpeople.                                
